        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2011 Wiley Periodicals, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "We report a case of a 69-year-old female with a previous Bentall procedure who developed a right coronary ostial aneurysm. The aneurysm was excluded with a Dacron patch and the right internal mammary artery was used to restore flow to the coronary artery."
